  "summary": "postinstall exfiltrates AWS log configuration to attacker ngrok tunnel",
  "details": "The package tarball contains only a package.json with a postinstall lifecycle script and no library code. On npm install, the postinstall runs a node one-liner that parses JSON lines for AWS LogOptions / awslogs-group / awslogs-stream fields and pipes the extracted data via curl POST to the hardcoded anonymous tunnel https://mourner-slot-explicit.ngrok-free.dev. The package ships no main entry, no source, and no README; the postinstall is the entire payload.",
